      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T07:30:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have tried `rules_jvm_external.maven_install()`. Unfortunately it doesn\u0027t pin versions exactly, which caused issues with Guice, because it installed 7.0 instead of 6.0, which would have required jakarta.inject instead of javax.inject. Thus, I don\u0027t believe that this would be a good and stable solution.",
      "parentUuid": "7b65235f_2c0121f8",
      "revId": "af8027caa5d19cccade6cec9380a89e5f2768986",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
