      "writtenOn": "2025-11-12T20:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Was that with a `maven_install.json` pinning them? https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_jvm_external?tab\u003dreadme-ov-file#pinning-artifacts-and-integration-with-bazels-downloader\n\nEven without that, I think JGit has it working correctly in https://gerrit-review.googlesource.com/c/jgit/+/517841/3/MODULE.bazel ?",
      "parentUuid": "22de80ba_4c138762",
      "revId": "af8027caa5d19cccade6cec9380a89e5f2768986",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
